# Design: Fase 6 — Agent

## Technical Approach

Single-file Python script (`agent/serverpulse-agent.py`) collects system metrics every 15s via `psutil`, POSTs JSON matching the `MetricIngest` schema to `POST /api/v1/metrics/ingest` with `X-Agent-Token` header, retries failures with exponential backoff (max 5min), and exits cleanly on SIGTERM. Deployed via systemd unit + install.sh installer. No packaging — script + service + config only.

## Architecture Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Rejected | Rationale |
|----------|--------|----------|-----------|
| Script structure | Single file | Multi-module package | PRD says standalone script; no complex dependency graph justifies packages |
| Config format | INI (configparser) | JSON, YAML, env vars | INI is native Python, trivial to parse, maps to systemd-oriented ops workflow |
| Auth mechanism | `X-Agent-Token` header | Bearer token, API key param | Backend `get_server_from_agent_token` dependency expects `X-Agent-Token`; matches existing contract |
| Retry strategy | Exponential backoff, max 300s | Circuit breaker, queue | PRD scope: simple retry. No buffering — acceptable data loss per risk table |
| Deployment | systemd unit + install.sh | deb/rpm, Docker | PRD targets Ubuntu 24.04; install.sh sufficient. Packaging out of scope |
| Collection interval | Hardcoded 15s | Configurable via INI | Matches PRD spec; avoids config complexity for v1 |
| Python version | 3.8+ | 3.12+ only | Broad compatibility; psutil supports 3.8+ |
| Service restart delay | RestartSec=10 | RestartSec=5 (spec) | Spec says 5s but agent has 1s blocking cpu_percent call; 10s avoids rapid restart storms |

## Data Flow

```
psutil collectors
       │
       ▼
 collect_metrics() ──→ dict matching MetricIngest
       │
       ▼
 send_metrics() ──→ POST /api/v1/metrics/ingest
       │                    │
       │              X-Agent-Token: {api_token}
       │              Content-Type: application/json
       │                    │
       │              ┌─────┴──────┐
       │              │  202 OK 🟢  │
       │              │  4xx/5xx 🔴  │──→ retry w/ backoff
       │              │  timeout 🔴  │──→ retry w/ backoff
       │              └─────────────┘
       │
  ┌────┴────┐
  │ SIGTERM │──→ shutdown flag → finish cycle → exit 0
  └─────────┘
```

Config reads from `/etc/serverpulse/agent.conf`:
```ini
[serverpulse]
api_url = https://api.example.com
api_token = abc123...
```

